  of the origami killer who kidnaps  children and leaves them to die it's a  real feel-good game in all seriousness  it's the most depressing game I've ever  played but it's deliberately done that  way playing between the father of the  kidnapped son a private investigator and  the journalist looking for a scoop on  the story heavy rain will have you  playing from all perspectives there's a  ton of endings to see - and it's even  possible for the main characters to die  heart  we're through the game the rest of the  game continued without their input  making small decisions extremely  stressful back in 2010 heavy rain  received eights and nines out of ten but  due to the general progress in the games  industry the ps4 version received around  seven out of ten will you be pressing X  to Jason over on the ps3 is Rayman HD  I'm not completely certain which version  of the game this is as Rayman HD is used  for about four games in the series it  could be a collection of Rayman titles  but I'm not certain but if I choose  wrong I'll make sure to pin a comment  below  in my opinion Rayman HD will most likely  be Rayman three hoodlum havoc as the  title suggests is the third game in the  series which is much more lighthearted  than the previous games in this  platformer you will attempt to stop  andrei an evil black alum from taking  over the world back in 2003  it receives scores as high as 83 out of  100 next on the ps3 is extreme exorcism  but don't worry the title is the  scariest part of this game using a retro  art style you'll battle through a  haunted house full of creatures and  threatens in a pseudo action platformer  you won't be using a Ouija board to get  rid of the ghosts you'll be using rocket  launchers and Sods the six people that  bother to review this gave it 74 out of  100 on Metacritic the first title over  on the beta is also available on your  ps4 it's space overlords first released  in 2016 which tasks you with destroying  planets here's the blurb for brothers  known as the overlords have been  imprisoned by the evil Cassidy on you  and your brothers must rise up and purge  the evil contaminating the planet the  ps4 version supports local multiplayer  by the way will you be trying this one  you'll be creating sharing and  destroying planets and to end here's a  game with a ridiculously long title zero  escape zero time dilemma this world is  an adventure title consisting of  multiple chapters it's part of the zero  escape series and is a prequel to 2012  virtues last reward expect loads of  moral decisions to make as you track  down zero a good old masked kidnapper so  that's all seven games to get your teeth  into oh and there's also a new character  skin and back bling in fortnight battle  royale what so what would you say this  must be was kidnap and destruction are  you happy with this monster tails or are  you little underwhelmed please share  your thoughts in the comments I'm Adam  from Playstation grenade it's been a  pleasure see you next time
 

